ext":"உரவோர்","lemma":"உரவோர்","gloss":"brave warrior"}],"gloss":"brave warrior"},{"surface":"மகனே","parts":[{"text":"மகன்","lemma":"மகன்","gloss":"son"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"the son"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உன்னிலன்","parts":[{"text":"உன்னிலன்","lemma":"உன்னிலன்","gloss":"he does not think/hesitate"}],"gloss":"he does not think of retreating"},{"surface":"என்னும்","parts":[{"text":"என்னும்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"saying"}],"gloss":"saying"},{"surface":"புண்ஒன்று","parts":[{"text":"புண்","lemma":"புண்","gloss":"wound"},{"text":"ஒன்று","lemma":"ஒன்று","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"one wound"},{"surface":"அம்பு","parts":[{"text":"அம்பு","lemma":"அம்பு","gloss":"arrow"}],"gloss":"arrow","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மான்உளை","parts":[{"text":"மான்","lemma":"மான்","gloss":"horse"},{"text":"உளை","lemma":"உளை","gloss":"mane"}],"gloss":"horse's mane"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"குடுமித்","parts":[{"text":"குடுமித்","lemma":"குடுமித்","gloss":"tuft of hair"}],"gloss":"tuft of hair","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தோல்மிசைக்","parts":[{"text":"தோல்மிசைக்","lemma":"தோல்மிசைக்","gloss":"upon the shield"}],"gloss":"upon the shield","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கிடந்த","parts":[{"text":"கிடந்த","lemma":"கிட","gloss":"lying"}],"gloss":"lying"},{"surface":"புல்அண","parts":[{"text":"புல்அண","lemma":"புல்அண","gloss":"sparse beard"}],"gloss":"sparse beard","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"லோனே","parts":[{"text":"லோனே","lemma":"லோனே","gloss":"he who has"}],"gloss":"he who has","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Milk having taken when fed, he would not drink, and so / without being angry, a raised small stick fearing / with distress he would suffer indeed. Now, / spotted-colored male elephants having slain without stopping, / the son of the brave warrior who fell on a previous day, / 'I will not think of retreating' saying, with an arrow in his wound, / like a horse's mane, with a tuft of hair, / upon his shield lies he of the sparse beard.","translation":"In the past, when milk was offered to him, he would refuse to drink, and he would shrink in distress, fearing even a small stick raised without anger. But now, this son of the brave warrior who fell in battle the other day has slain spotted elephants without stopping. Saying 'I will not think of retreating,' with an arrow piercing his wound, he lies dead upon his shield, his sparse beard matching his tuft of hair that looks like a horse's mane.","modern":"முன்பு, பால் கொடுத்து ஊட்டினாலும் அவன் குடிக்க மாட்டான். கோபமின்றி ஓங்கிய சிறு கோலைக் கண்டு அஞ்சி வருந்துவான். ஆனால் இப்போதோ, முந்தைய நாளில் போரில் வீழ்ந்த வீரனின் மகனாகிய இவன், புள்ளிகளையுடைய யானைகளைக் கொன்று குவித்தான். 'பின்வாங்க நினைக்க மாட்டேன்' என்று கூறி, உடலில் அம்பு தைத்த புண்ணோடு, குதிரையின் பிடரி மயிர் போன்ற குடுமியையும், சிறிய தாடியையும் உடையவனாய், தன் கேடயத்தின் மேல் இறந்து கிடக்கிறான்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Tumpai tiṇai (battle) and the theme is Nūḻilāṭṭu (the heroic stand of a single warrior). The poet Ponmuṭiyār describes a young warrior who has fallen in battle. In his childhood, he was so tender and timid that he would refuse milk and cry in fear at the sight of a small stick raised without any real anger. Now, as the son of a brave warrior who died in battle the previous day, he has slain many war elephants. Refusing to retreat, he lies dead upon his shield with an arrow in his wound, his youthful sparse beard and horse-mane-like tuft of hair marking his transition from a delicate boy to a heroic martyr.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.4],[1.48,1.7],[1.7,2.3],[2.3,3.3],[3.6,3.8],[3.8,4.0],[4.1,4.3],[4.43,4.7],[4.7,6.0],[6.0,6.2],[6.2,6.6],[6.6,7.6],[7.6,8.0],[8.0,8.62],[8.62,9.0],[9.0,9.4],[9.4,9.6],[9.6,10.1],[10.1,10.5],[10.5,10.71],[10.71,12.0],[12.0,12.6],[12.6,13.1],[13.1,13.79],[13.79,14.3],[14.3,14.5],[14.5,15.98],[15.98,16.22],[16.22,16.34],[16.34,16.7]],"female":[[0.0,0.88],[0.88,1.5],[1.5,2.0],[2.0,2.85],[2.85,3.7],[3.95,4.2],[4.2,4.4],[4.5,5.2],[5.2,6.1],[6.1,6.5],[6.5,6.8],[6.8,7.2],[7.2,8.3],[8.3,8.9],[8.9,9.2],[9.2,10.0],[10.0,10.45],[10.45,10.9],[10.9,11.5],[11.5,12.0],[12.0,13.0],[13.0,13.53],[13.53,14.2],[14.2,14.63],[14.63,15.3],[15.3,15.8],[15.8,16.0],[16.0,17.18],[17.4,17.8],[17.8,18.2],[18.3,18.6]]},"sync":[[["பால்கொண்டு","having taken milk"]],[["மடுப்பவும்","even when fed"]],[["உண்ணான்","he would not drink"]],[["ஆகலின்","because of that"]],[["செறாஅது","without being angry"]],[["ஓச்சிய","raised"]],[["சிறுகோல்","small stick"]],[["அஞ்சியடு","fearing and"]],[["உயவொடு","with distress"]],[["வருந்தும்","he would suffer"]],[["மன்னே","indeed in the past"]],[["இனியே","but now"]],[["புகர்நிறங்","spotted color"]],[["கொண்ட","having"]],[["களிறட்டு","having killed male elephants"]],[["ஆனான்","he did not stop"]],[["முன்நாள்","previous day"]],[["வீழ்ந்த","who fell"]],[["உரவோர்","brave warrior"]],[["மகனே","the son"]],[["உன்னிலன்","he does not think of retreating"]],[["என்னும்","saying"]],[["புண்ஒன்று","one wound"]],[["அம்பு","arrow"]],[["மான்உளை","horse's mane"]],[["அன்ன","like"]],[["குடுமித்","tuft of hair"]],[["தோல்மிசைக்","upon the shield"]],[["கிடந்த","lying"]],[["புல்அண","sparse beard"]],[["லோனே","he who has"]]]}